                   {{ill|Sakami-zuo-no-Ōgami|de|Sakami-zuo-no-Ōgami|ja|酒弥豆男神|zh|酒弥豆男神|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sakami-zuo-no-Ōgami|qq=}}<br>
